  <prompt>
    Migrate the create-record wizards' email step to the canonical `&lt;EmailComposer /&gt;` (via the W2 `&lt;SendEmailStep /&gt;` wrapper), and retire the LegalWorkspace CreateMatter fork:

    1. **Shared step (4 wizards in one edit)** — replace the BODY of `src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateRecordWizard/steps/SendEmailStep.tsx` with a thin layer that mounts the canonical `&lt;SendEmailStep /&gt;` wrapper. Per empirical finding #5/#12, this single shared file is the source for CreateProject, CreateEvent, CreateTodo, and CreateWorkAssignment — so one body rewrite migrates all four. Preserve the exported component's public prop API so the 4 callers compile unchanged. Remove all inline composer/validation/recipient-parsing/`fetch` logic.

    2. **CreateMatter fork (the ONLY true LegalWorkspace fork)** — per empirical finding #5, `src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/components/CreateMatter/SendEmailStep.tsx` is the single genuine LegalWorkspace email-step fork (Project/Event/Todo/WorkAssignment dirs exist but have NO SendEmailStep). Point the CreateMatter caller at the canonical `&lt;SendEmailStep /&gt;` from `@spaarke/ui-components`, then delete the fork file. Also migrate the shared-lib `CreateMatterWizard/SendEmailStep.tsx` (if a separate per-Matter file exists) to the canonical wrapper.

    3. **Cross-package import** — resolve `WorkAssignmentWizardDialog.tsx:31` (empirical finding #7): replace the relative source-path import `from '../CreateRecordWizard/steps/SendEmailStep'` with the package barrel import `from '@spaarke/ui-components'`. Re-grep to relocate the exact line; match the canonical export name.

    After this task, no create-record wizard uses inline composer/`fetch` logic, no LegalWorkspace email-step fork remains, and no cross-package source-path import to the email step remains.
  </prompt>

  <role>
    Spaarke frontend engineer authoritative on shared-library wizard step contracts, the `@spaarke/ui-components` public barrel (`src/index.ts`), the canonical `&lt;SendEmailStep /&gt;` wrapper (W2 task 021), and the LegalWorkspace solution structure.
  </role>

  <goal>
    The shared `CreateRecordWizard/steps/SendEmailStep.tsx` is a thin transformation layer over the canonical wrapper; all 4 consuming wizards build with no behavior change. `src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/components/CreateMatter/SendEmailStep.tsx` is deleted and its caller imports from `@spaarke/ui-components`. `WorkAssignmentWizardDialog.tsx` imports `SendEmailStep` from the package barrel, not a relative path. `@spaarke/ui-components` and LegalWorkspace both build (`build:prod`) and lint clean.
  </goal>

